{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a responsive Shopify homepage section called “Choose Your Path.”
    
    Build this as an editable Shopify theme section with settings in the theme editor, so I can change all images, headings, subheadings, button text, button links, colors, font sizes, font styles, spacing, and opacity without editing code.
    
    The section should have three side-by-side image cards on desktop and stack vertically on mobile.
    
    Each card should include:
    
    Image
    
    Centered text overlay on the image
    
    A semi-transparent box directly behind the heading and subheading only
    
    Small heading inside the overlay box
    
    Short subheading inside the overlay box
    
    Filled button below the image, outside the image overlay
    
    Button link that can be selected in the theme editor
    
    The button must be below the image, not on top of the image.
    
    The transparent overlay box should sit only behind the heading and subheading. Do not darken the entire image. Do not place the button inside the overlay box.
    
    Each card should have editable settings for:
    
    Image
    
    Heading
    
    Subheading
    
    Button text
    
    Button link
    
    Heading color
    
    Heading font size
    
    Heading font family or font style
    
    Heading letter spacing
    
    Subheading color
    
    Subheading font size
    
    Subheading font family or font style
    
    Subheading line height
    
    Overlay box background color
    
    Overlay box opacity
    
    Overlay box padding
    
    Overlay box border radius
    
    Overlay box width or max-width
    
    Button color
    
    Button text color
    
    Button font size
    
    Button border radius
    
    Section-level editable settings should include:
    
    Section heading
    
    Section subheading
    
    Section heading color
    
    Section heading font size
    
    Section heading font family or font style
    
    Section subheading color
    
    Section subheading font size
    
    Section subheading font family or font style
    
    Background color
    
    Card gap
    
    Image height desktop
    
    Image height mobile
    
    Image border radius
    
    Button color
    
    Button hover color
    
    Text box opacity
    
    Text box background color
    
    Default layout and style:
    
    Clean, warm, polished, and clinical
    
    Rounded image corners
    
    Centered overlay box on each image
    
    Centered button under each image
    
    Dark blue or deep green filled buttons
    
    White or warm cream overlay text
    
    Dark navy or charcoal transparent overlay box
    
    Soft spacing between image and button
    
    Responsive and accessible on mobile
    
    Default section heading:
    
    Choose Your Path
    
    Default section subheading:
    
    Therapy, evaluations, and professional training each begin with careful listening, clinical clarity, and respect for the whole person.
    
    Default card 1:
    
    Heading: Begin Therapy
    
    Subheading: Support for healing and change.
    
    Button text: Explore Therapy
    
    Default card 2:
    
    Heading: Get an Evaluation
    
    Subheading: Clarity for diagnosis and next steps.
    
    Button text: Explore Evaluations
    
    Default card 3:
    
    Heading: Learn With Us
    
    Subheading: Clinical training, supervision, and consultation.
    
    Button text: Learn With Us
    
    Important design requirements:
    
    The overlay box must be a separate editable design element behind the heading and subheading.
    
    The overlay box must have opacity controls in the theme editor.
    
    The heading and subheading must each have editable controls for color, size, and font style.
    
    The section heading and section subheading must also have editable controls for color, size, and font style.
    
    All text, images, buttons, links, colors, font sizes, font styles, opacity, padding, image height, and spacing should be editable later from the Shopify theme editor without touching code.
    
    Make sure the overlay text remains readable on busy nature images., the overlay box needs to be able to be bigger both width and height for the text , each of the text boxes should be centered and bottom to the image
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-choose-path-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background_color }};
    padding: 60px 20px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1340px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-section-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.section_heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.section_heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.section_heading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.section_heading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.section_heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.section_heading_size }}px;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-section-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.section_subheading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.section_subheading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.section_subheading_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.section_subheading_font.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.section_subheading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.section_subheading_size }}px;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height_desktop }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.image_button_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-overlay-box-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.overlay_bottom_position_1 }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 2;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.text_box_background_color }};
    opacity: {{ block.settings.text_box_opacity }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.overlay_padding_1 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.overlay_border_radius_1 }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.overlay_width_1 }}%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.overlay_max_width_1 }}px;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.overlay_min_height_1 }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-overlay-box-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.overlay_bottom_position_2 }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 2;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.text_box_background_color }};
    opacity: {{ block.settings.text_box_opacity }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.overlay_padding_2 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.overlay_border_radius_2 }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.overlay_width_2 }}%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.overlay_max_width_2 }}px;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.overlay_min_height_2 }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-overlay-box-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.overlay_bottom_position_3 }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 2;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.text_box_background_color }};
    opacity: {{ block.settings.text_box_opacity }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.overlay_padding_3 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.overlay_border_radius_3 }}px;
    width: {{ block.settings.overlay_width_3 }}%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.overlay_max_width_3 }}px;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.overlay_min_height_3 }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-text-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.overlay_bottom_position_1 }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 3;
    width: 90%;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-text-content-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.overlay_bottom_position_2 }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 3;
    width: 90%;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-text-content-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: {{ block.settings.overlay_bottom_position_3 }}px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    text-align: center;
    z-index: 3;
    width: 90%;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-heading-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font_1.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font_1.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font_1.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font_1.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color_1 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_1 }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing_1 }}px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-heading-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font_2.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font_2.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font_2.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font_2.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color_2 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_2 }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing_2 }}px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-heading-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font_3.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font_3.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font_3.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.heading_font_3.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color_3 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_3 }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing_3 }}px;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-subheading-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_1.family }}, {{ block.settings.subheading_font_1.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_1.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_1.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color_1 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size_1 }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subheading_line_height_1 }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-subheading-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_2.family }}, {{ block.settings.subheading_font_2.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_2.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_2.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color_2 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size_2 }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subheading_line_height_2 }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-subheading-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_3.family }}, {{ block.settings.subheading_font_3.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_3.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.subheading_font_3.style }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color_3 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size_3 }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subheading_line_height_3 }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-button-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_color_1 }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color_1 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size_1 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius_1 }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-button-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_color_2 }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color_2 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size_2 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius_2 }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-button-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_color_3 }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color_3 }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size_3 }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius_3 }}px;
  }

  .ai-choose-path-button-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-choose-path-button-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-choose-path-button-3-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-choose-path-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .ai-choose-path-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: {{ block.settings.image_height_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-choose-path-section-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.section_heading_size }}px * 0.8);
    }

    .ai-choose-path-section-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.section_subheading_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-choose-path-heading-1-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-choose-path-heading-2-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-choose-path-heading-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.heading_size_1 }}px * 0.85);
    }

    .ai-choose-path-subheading-1-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-choose-path-subheading-2-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-choose-path-subheading-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.subheading_size_1 }}px * 0.9);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-choose-path-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-choose-path-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-choose-path-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.section_heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-choose-path-section-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.section_heading }}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.section_subheading != blank %}
        <p class="ai-choose-path-section-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.section_subheading }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-choose-path-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-choose-path-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-choose-path-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.image_1 %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.image_1 | image_url: width: 800 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.image_1.alt | escape }}"
              class="ai-choose-path-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image_1.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_1.height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-choose-path-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-choose-path-overlay-box-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

          <div class="ai-choose-path-text-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.heading_1 != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-choose-path-heading-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.heading_1 }}
              </h3>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.subheading_1 != blank %}
              <p class="ai-choose-path-subheading-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.subheading_1 }}
              </p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        {% if block.settings.button_text_1 != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.button_link_1 }}"
            class="ai-choose-path-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-choose-path-button-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            {{ block.settings.button_text_1 }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-choose-path-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-choose-path-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.image_2 %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.image_2 | image_url: width: 800 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.image_2.alt | escape }}"
              class="ai-choose-path-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image_2.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_2.height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-choose-path-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-choose-path-overlay-box-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

          <div class="ai-choose-path-text-content-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.heading_2 != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-choose-path-heading-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.heading_2 }}
              </h3>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.subheading_2 != blank %}
              <p class="ai-choose-path-subheading-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.subheading_2 }}
              </p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        {% if block.settings.button_text_2 != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.button_link_2 }}"
            class="ai-choose-path-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-choose-path-button-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            {{ block.settings.button_text_2 }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-choose-path-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-choose-path-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.image_3 %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.image_3 | image_url: width: 800 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.image_3.alt | escape }}"
              class="ai-choose-path-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image_3.width }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_3.height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-choose-path-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="ai-choose-path-overlay-box-3-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

          <div class="ai-choose-path-text-content-3-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.heading_3 != blank %}
              <h3 class="ai-choose-path-heading-3-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.heading_3 }}
              </h3>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.subheading_3 != blank %}
              <p class="ai-choose-path-subheading-3-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.subheading_3 }}
              </p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>

        {% if block.settings.button_text_3 != blank %}
          <a
            href="{{ block.settings.button_link_3 }}"
            class="ai-choose-path-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-choose-path-button-3-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
            {{ block.settings.button_text_3 }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Choose your path",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Choose Your Path"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "section_heading_color",
      "label": "Heading color",
      "default": "#1a3a52"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_heading_size",
      "label": "Heading size",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 48
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "section_heading_font",
      "label": "Heading font",
      "default": "helvetica_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section subheading"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "section_subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Therapy, evaluations, and professional training each begin with careful listening, clinical clarity, and respect for the whole person."
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "section_subheading_color",
      "label": "Subheading color",
      "default": "#4a5568"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_subheading_size",
      "label": "Subheading size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 32,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "section_subheading_font",
      "label": "Subheading font",
      "default": "helvetica_n4"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "section_background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#f7f3ef"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_gap",
      "label": "Gap between items",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 30
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Image settings"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_height_desktop",
      "label": "Image height (desktop)",
      "min": 200,
      "max": 600,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 400
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_height_mobile",
      "label": "Image height (mobile)",
      "min": 200,
      "max": 500,
      "step": 20,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 300
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_border_radius",
      "label": "Image border radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 40,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_button_spacing",
      "label": "Space between image and button",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Overlay box style"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_box_background_color",
